<title>POLAND: KREDYT BANK OCT NET RISES TO PLN 2.4 MLN.</title>
<headline>KREDYT BANK OCT NET RISES TO PLN 2.4 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-11-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results October</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>OCTOBER</p>
<p> Net profit					  2.41 vs    0.70</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit				    3.80 vs    1.43</p>
<p> Profit on banking operations		 15.07 vs    8.27</p>
<p> Interest and other related revenues	23.53 vs   16.02</p>
<p>JANUARY-OCTOBER</p>
<p> Net profit					 19.43 vs    8.85</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit				   33.50 vs   18.41</p>
<p> Profit on banking operations		119.56 vs   74.54</p>
<p> Interest and other related revenues     198.48 vs  141.97</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish bank is Kredyt Bank SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
